%% alt: presearch ingestion pipeline — Cloud Scheduler wakes a Cloud Run Job every day at 08:00, collecting Naver search volume and stock prices into BigQuery. A coverage gate checks the data-readiness rate for the target date and halts publishing if insufficient
flowchart TD
  S["Cloud Scheduler<br/>Daily 08:00 KST"] --> J["Cloud Run Job"]
  J --> N["Naver DataLab<br/>Search volume"]
  J --> P["Stock price · Trading value"]
  N --> BQ["BigQuery"]
  P --> BQ
  BQ --> G{"Coverage gate<br/>Target date readiness"}
  G -->|"Sufficient"| API["Cloud Run<br/>FastAPI → React"]
  G -->|"Insufficient (fresh 0/400)"| STOP["Halt<br/>Don't publish partial data"]
